## 🔁 Git Rules
- Use `git pull --rebase` to maintain a linear history.
- No merge commits in feature branches – squash & rebase before merging to `main`.
- Commit messages must be clear and scoped (e.g., `feat(auth): add Google SSO`).
- Branch naming:  
  - `backend/feature/...`, `frontend/feature/...`, `bugfix/...`, `refactor/...`
- Always use `.gitignore` to exclude IDE and build files (`/target`, `/node_modules`, etc.)

